        "b_vetiver": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The one essential oil",
            "body": "<p>There is a single essential oil in the range, and we would rather name it than let you wonder. <a href=\"https://biotaderm.com/blogs/ingredients/vetiver-vetiveria-zizanioides-root-oil\">Vetiver root oil</a>, from <em>Vetiveria Zizanioides</em>, is a natural essential oil obtained from the roots of the grass. It is not a synthetic fragrance and nothing like one. We include it at a tenth of a percent, the same level in every product, for the quiet natural note it lends the blend.</p><p>A concentrated aromatic can still be a lot for a fragile barrier, which is why the level is kept low and why a patch test is worth the trouble if your skin runs reactive. It is named on the label under its own name, so you can see it and decide for yourself.</p>",
            "caveat": "",
